<title>FRANCE: France's DMC surges on bourse.</title>
<headline>France's DMC surges on bourse.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in French textile group DMC were up 10.47 percent at 115 francs at 0905 GMT on Thursday after having been briefly suspended limit-up.</p>
<p>The new limits are set at 120.20 francs and 108.80, said a spokeswoman for the French stockmarkets association SBF.</p>
